682414\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"242.03674540682414\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"58.0236,363.8 77.4246153846154,326.0 144.41230769230765,256.0 253.585,161.68421052631578 343.31480519480516,136.1818181818182 407.25686274509803,46.54901960784315\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 5% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 300 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"58.0236\" cy=\"363.8\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 5%&amp;#10;It rained 15% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 78 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"77.4246153846154\" cy=\"326.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 24%&amp;#10;It rained 35% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 78 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"144.41230769230765\" cy=\"256.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 55%&amp;#10;It rained 61% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 76 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"253.585\" cy=\"161.68421052631578\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 81%&amp;#10;It rained 68% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 77 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"343.31480519480516\" cy=\"136.1818181818182\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 92% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 153 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"407.25686274509803\" cy=\"46.54901960784315\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(38%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Frankfurt am Main the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>winter</b> (0.50) and least in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.44).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>46%</td><td class='num'>0.440</td><td class='num'>8.4%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>218</td><td class='num'>29%</td><td class='num'>0.471</td><td class='num'>3.9%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>39%</td><td class='num'>0.482</td><td class='num'>7.3%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>42%</td><td class='num'>0.505</td><td class='num'>5.0%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":50.11552,"lon":8.68417,"n":762,"n_cities":134,"name":"Frankfurt am Main","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.03,"lo":0.0,"mean":6.666666666666667e-05,"n":300,"obs":0.05,"sig":true},{"hi":0.13,"lo":0.03,"mean":0.05487179487179489,"n":78,"obs":0.15384615384615385,"sig":true},{"hi":0.4,"lo":0.13,"mean":0.24410256410256403,"n":78,"obs":0.34615384615384615,"sig":true},{"hi":0.7,"lo":0.4,"mean